<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  English strings for the sdl2_desktop platform's ImGui UI.

  This file is the permanent fallback layer (see sdl2_desktop_i18n.h/.cpp):
  every other res/lang/<code>.xml is only ever an *overlay* on top of this
  one, so a string missing from a translation still shows in English
  instead of going blank. Keep every id here even if a translation covers
  it too - id/text pairs, one <string> per line so no stray
  whitespace/indentation ends up inside the translated text itself.
-->
